So, I was by myself, so I picked work.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:53.752
And I said I liked the
energy of an office.

00:11:53.752 --> 00:11:56.281
And then, it has me
working from the beach!

00:11:56.281 --> 00:11:57.131
(Nina laughing)

00:11:57.131 --> 00:11:57.964
I don't want to work on the,

00:11:57.964 --> 00:11:59.412
I don't want to work on the beach, guys!

00:11:59.412 --> 00:12:00.745
I don't want to work, I
want to work in an office,

00:12:00.745 --> 00:12:01.578
and get stuff done.

00:12:01.578 --> 00:12:03.145
I don't want to work from the beach.

00:12:03.145 --> 00:12:04.956
What's work on the beach?

00:12:04.956 --> 00:12:07.493
I want to work from an
office, and get stuff done.

00:12:07.493 --> 00:12:09.612
I'm upset about my future.

00:12:09.612 --> 00:12:12.469
You know what, I'm not going to
accept that future! (chuckles)

00:12:12.469 --> 00:12:14.444
I'm going to make my own future!

00:12:14.444 --> 00:12:16.996
Take that, Epcot future!

00:12:16.996 --> 00:12:18.383
Going to make my own!

00:12:18.383 --> 00:12:22.031
I get to work from an office,
and get lots of stuff done.

00:12:22.031 --> 00:12:24.412
And I'm not making surfboards, either.

00:12:24.412 --> 00:12:28.092
I'm making something
more valuable, impactful,

00:12:28.092 --> 00:12:30.483
changing entrepreneur.

00:12:30.483 --> 00:12:31.473
- Change time!

00:12:31.473 --> 00:12:33.122
(Evan laughing)

00:12:33.122 --> 00:12:36.289
(slow relaxing music)

00:12:37.513 --> 00:12:38.346
- [Evan] Oh, Nina.

00:12:38.346 --> 00:12:39.330
Hello.
- Hello.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:40.438
- [Evan] Who's this?

00:12:40.438 --> 00:12:41.728
I feel like these steps of Mexico

00:12:41.728 --> 00:12:43.768
are a lot shorter than last time.

00:12:43.768 --> 00:12:45.535
Fancy meeting you here.

00:12:45.535 --> 00:12:46.368
Huh?

00:12:46.368 --> 00:12:47.861
- Imagine this, meeting you here!

00:12:47.861 --> 00:12:48.740
- [Evan] Isn't this where we,

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.548
haven't I seen you here before?

00:12:50.548 --> 00:12:52.388
I feel like I've seen you here before.

00:12:52.388 --> 00:12:54.063
It's a very special place for us.

00:12:54.063 --> 00:12:55.700
- Oh, 'cause we met here.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.783
- We met here, in Mexico.

00:12:58.907 --> 00:13:01.520
Last year, we were here,
and I picked her up.

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:02.477
Oh, who's this?

00:13:02.477 --> 00:13:05.809
Hello. (exclaims)

00:13:05.809 --> 00:13:07.642
What's your name, huh?

00:13:08.532 --> 00:13:10.227
Imagine meeting you, in a place like this.

00:13:10.227 --> 00:13:12.552
(Nina chuckling)

00:13:12.552 --> 00:13:15.538
I get to sit with Nina up front! (howls)

00:13:15.538 --> 00:13:17.689
And who's behind us?
- The kids!

00:13:17.689 --> 00:13:19.189
- Who's behind us?

00:13:20.411 --> 00:13:21.244
Yeah.

00:13:21.244 --> 00:13:24.661
(lively mid-tempo music)

00:13:37.721 --> 00:13:39.526
What did we think of the ride, Hayden?

00:13:39.526 --> 00:13:40.435
- [Hayden] Awesome!

00:13:40.435 --> 00:13:41.268
- [Evan] Awesome?

00:13:41.268 --> 00:13:43.726
- Now, we're going to run,
all the way to ice cream!

00:13:43.726 --> 00:13:45.189
- [Evan] We're going to run to ice cream?

00:13:45.189 --> 00:13:46.022
- [Hayden] Yeah!

00:13:46.022 --> 00:13:47.288
- [Evan] We're going to run to ice cream.

00:13:47.288 --> 00:13:49.740
I told the kids we can either go slowly,

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:51.200
and just go to the Figment ride,

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:54.436
or we can rush, and do ice
cream and Figment ride.

00:13:54.436 --> 00:13:56.974
Guess what they wanted to do?

00:13:56.974 --> 00:13:58.047
And we're rushed.

00:13:58.047 --> 00:14:01.464
(groovy energetic music)

00:14:26.515 --> 00:14:30.682
Nina's havin' some rum in
her coffee, in her ice cream.

00:14:32.142 --> 00:14:33.193
Okay, don't get drunk, Nina.

00:14:33.193 --> 00:14:34.266
- I probably will get drunk.

00:14:34.266 --> 00:14:35.099
- [Evan] There she goes.

00:14:35.099 --> 00:14:36.368
You know, that's not on the menu.

00:14:36.368 --> 00:14:37.201
- Whoa.

00:14:37.201 --> 00:14:38.783
- [Evan] Off the menu.

00:14:38.783 --> 00:14:39.694
What do ya think?

00:14:39.694 --> 00:14:40.614
Strong.
- Strong.

00:14:40.614 --> 00:14:43.031
- [Evan] How's the ice cream?

00:14:45.896 --> 00:14:47.011
- Yummy.
(Evan exclaiming)

00:14:47.011 --> 00:14:49.722
- This is really, really good.

00:14:49.722 --> 00:14:51.312
(exclaims) So good.

00:14:51.312 --> 00:14:54.901
Nina's havin' a hard
time with the ice cream.

00:14:54.901 --> 00:14:56.824
- It's so strong. (chuckles)

00:14:56.824 --> 00:14:57.657
- [Evan] Okay?

00:14:57.657 --> 00:14:58.490
You like your rum.

00:14:58.490 --> 00:14:59.849
You're a rum-a-holic.
- Yeah.

00:14:59.849 --> 00:15:01.050
- [Evan] Finish that up, drink it down!

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:01.883
- I can't, I can't--

00:15:01.883 --> 00:15:02.716
- [Evan] Drink it down!

00:15:02.716 --> 00:15:03.880
Okay, down it!
- Drink it slowly!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.651
- [Evan] Chug, chug, chug!

00:15:05.651 --> 00:15:07.169
That's off-the-menu stuff right there.

00:15:07.169 --> 00:15:10.092
You got to do your research,
get some special service.

00:15:10.092 --> 00:15:11.479
Yeah.

00:15:11.479 --> 00:15:12.669
Suck it down, Nina!

00:15:12.669 --> 00:15:13.917
Hello! (exclaims)

00:15:13.917 --> 00:15:17.081
(laughs) It's amazing.

00:15:17.081 --> 00:15:20.414
(light energetic music)

00:15:27.959 --> 00:15:30.287
We've got Jeffrey up front!

00:15:30.287 --> 00:15:32.031
We got me up front!

00:15:32.031 --> 00:15:35.218
We got the three kids behind!

00:15:35.218 --> 00:15:36.226
You excited?
- Yep!

00:15:36.226 --> 00:15:37.226
- [Evan] Yo!

00:15:53.385 --> 00:15:54.924
What'd ya think, guys?

00:15:54.924 --> 00:15:55.757
- [Jeffrey and Stephanie] Good!

00:15:55.757 --> 00:15:57.884
- [Evan] Hayden's still singing.

00:15:57.884 --> 00:16:00.055
- Oh, is the ride done?

00:16:00.055 --> 00:16:01.565
Oh, the ride's done.

00:16:01.565 --> 00:16:02.816
- [Evan] What'd ya think?

00:16:02.816 --> 00:16:03.945
- [Jeffrey] Awesome!

00:16:03.945 --> 00:16:07.700
- Aright, next up, time to
watch some short films, yeah!

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:11.283
(mid-tempo relaxing music)

00:16:13.598 --> 00:16:14.521
How was it?

00:16:14.521 --> 00:16:15.528
- Fun!

00:16:15.528 --> 00:16:16.608
It's cute.

00:16:16.608 --> 00:16:17.441
- [Stephanie] Very funny!

00:16:17.441 --> 00:16:18.396
- [Evan] Very funny?

00:16:18.396 --> 00:16:19.246
Alright.

00:16:19.246 --> 00:16:20.939
- It came down naked.

00:16:20.939 --> 00:16:22.117
- [Evan] It came down naked.

00:16:22.117 --> 00:16:23.449
The birds.

00:16:23.449 --> 00:16:25.002
Alright, glad you enjoyed!

00:16:25.002 --> 00:16:28.585
(mid-tempo relaxing music)

00:16:34.392 --> 00:16:36.432
That's the end of day three for us!

00:16:36.432 --> 00:16:37.311
Favorite ride?

00:16:37.311 --> 00:16:39.561
- My favorite ride?

00:16:39.561 --> 00:16:42.072
Is the future ride at Test Tracks.

00:16:42.072 --> 00:16:44.993
- Test Track, Nina, favorite ride?

00:16:44.993 --> 00:16:46.707
- (chuckles) I don't know.

00:16:46.707 --> 00:16:48.396
- [Evan] Jeffery, favorite ride?

00:16:48.396 --> 00:16:49.229
- Test Track.

00:16:49.229 --> 00:16:50.497
- [Evan] Test Track.

00:16:50.497 --> 00:16:51.330
My favorite ride

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:54.091
was watching Nina eat all
that ice cream alcohol.

00:16:54.091 --> 00:16:55.341
That was great.

00:16:56.221 --> 00:16:57.782
Alright, thank you guys, for joining us!

00:16:57.782 --> 00:16:58.615
Day three!

00:17:00.218 --> 00:17:01.828
We'll see you again, tomorrow!

00:17:01.828 --> 00:17:03.495
Continue to believe!

00:17:04.748 --> 00:17:06.665
And we'll see you soon!

